Package: ChIPBindVis
Type: Package
Title: ChIP-seq Binding Visualization at Target Gene Promoters
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Changhao",
                  family = "Kan",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "kanchanghao@example.com")
Description: One-command, publication-ready ChIP-seq binding visualization
    at target gene promoters. Given a bigWig signal file and a narrowPeak
    (or broadPeak) file, produces (A) a Gviz genome-browser track centered
    on a target gene's TSS and (B) a strand-aware EnrichedHeatmap across all
    peak-annotated target gene TSSs, with the query gene highlighted.
    Supports human (hg38, hg19) and mouse (mm10, mm39) reference assemblies.
    Annotation packages for each genome are loaded on demand.
